{
  "id": "LEV.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "LEV",
  "reference": "Leviticus 16",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to Moses after the death of the two sons of Aaron who were killed when they offered unholy fire to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.6.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 6.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said, “Tell your brother Aaron that only at the proper time is he to go behind the curtain into the Most Holy Place, because that is where I appear in a cloud above the lid on the Covenant Box. If he disobeys, he will be killed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 9.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He may enter the Most Holy Place only after he has brought a young bull for a sin offering and a ram for a burnt offering.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gave the following instructions. Before Aaron goes into the Most Holy Place, he must have a bath and put on the priestly garments: the linen robe and shorts, the belt, and the turban.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The community of Israel shall give Aaron two male goats for a sin offering and a ram for a burnt offering. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall offer a bull as a sacrifice to take away his own sins and those of his family. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he shall take the two goats to the entrance of the Tent of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There he shall draw lots, using two stones, one marked “for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "” and the other “for Azazel”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16.8; 16.20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Azazel",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": The meaning of this Hebrew word is unknown; it may be the name of a desert demon.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aaron shall sacrifice the goat chosen by lot for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and offer it as a sin offering. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The goat chosen for Azazel shall be presented alive to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and sent off into the desert to Azazel, in order to take away the sins of the people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Aaron sacrifices the bull as the sin offering for himself and his family, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he shall take a firepan full of burning coals from the altar and two handfuls of fine incense and bring them into the Most Holy Place. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There in the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence he shall put the incense on the fire, and the smoke of the incense will hide the lid of the Covenant Box so that he will not see it and die. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall take some of the bull's blood and with his finger sprinkle it on the front of the lid and then sprinkle some of it seven times in front of the Covenant Box.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 9.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After that, he shall kill the goat for the sin offering for the people, bring its blood into the Most Holy Place, and sprinkle it on the lid and then in front of the Covenant Box, as he did with the bull's blood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In this way he will perform the ritual to purify the Most Holy Place from the uncleanness of the people of Israel and from all their sins. He must do this to the Tent, because it stands in the middle of the camp, which is ritually unclean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the time Aaron enters the Most Holy Place to perform the ritual of purification until he comes out, there must be no one in the Tent. When he has performed the ritual for himself, his family, and the whole community, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he must then go out to the altar for burnt offerings and purify it. He must take some of the bull's blood and some of the goat's blood and put it all over the projections at the corners of the altar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With his finger he must sprinkle some of the blood on the altar seven times. In this way he is to purify it from the sins of the people of Israel and make it holy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Aaron has finished performing the ritual to purify the Most Holy Place, the rest of the Tent of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence, and the altar, he shall present to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the live goat chosen for Azazel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16.20; 16.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Azazel",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": The meaning of this Hebrew word is unknown; it may be the name of a desert demon.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall put both his hands on the goat's head and confess over it all the evils, sins, and rebellions of the people of Israel, and so transfer them to the goat's head. Then the goat is to be driven off into the desert by someone appointed to do it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The goat will carry all their sins away with him into some uninhabited land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.44.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 44.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Aaron shall go into the Tent, take off the priestly garments that he had put on before entering the Most Holy Place, and leave them there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He must bathe in a holy place and put on his own clothes. After that, he shall go out and offer the burnt offering to remove his own sins and those of the people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall burn on the altar the fat of the animal for the sin offering. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The man who drove the goat into the desert to Azazel must wash his clothes and have a bath before he comes back into camp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.13.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 13.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The bull and the goat used for the sin offering, whose blood was brought into the Most Holy Place to take away sin, shall be carried outside the camp and burnt. Skin, meat, and intestines shall all be burnt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The one who burns them must wash his clothes and have a bath before he returns to camp.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
